      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 8,
      "original_position": 5,
      "content": "安装脚本在沙箱内因权限问题失败（tar 无法更改文件所有权）。我先看看安装脚本做了什么，再决定怎么处理："
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_4af767266aac:msg_12",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 25963,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 12,
      "original_position": 6,
      "content": "脚本用 `tar -xzf` 解压时保留了包内 uid 501 的所有权，容器里 chown 受限导致失败。我手动下载并用 `--no-same-owner` 解压绕过这个问题。先看下脚本解压后的安装逻辑："
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_4af767266aac:msg_14",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 25964,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
