      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 25965,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 16,
      "original_position": 8,
      "content": "注意到沙箱 HOME 是 `/workspace`，但当前 Agent 的 skills 目录在 `/home/km-agent/skills/`。确认一下目录情况："
    },
